        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/speedyolrac/{size}/1918_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-12-14T00:04:30.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>If they don't wanna talk it is fine. they can lose out on that, but the game will not continue long enough for that to come into effect.</p><p>I think the official&nbsp;is rolling the environment&nbsp;and make her actions of that. I Would just roll whatever dice I want and make her do whatever. They do not have the power to stop her physically, and she cannot be killed. If they only speak in fist fights make sure she hits them hard enough to make then think about talking.&nbsp; One can also say she ignores all their attack for they are too weak. It might be though but this might be a good teaching moment.</p>",
