        "created_at": "2017-12-18T22:07:43.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>That's fair, and is probably a good plan given the rest of the adventures (that I've read so far).&nbsp; A group that defaults to punching threats until they stop moving will not do well with this product.&nbsp; On the other hand, I'm also worried that they won't enjoy these scenarios at all, so I'm curious to see how it all turns out.</p>",
