        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/speedyolrac/{size}/1918_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-12-19T13:36:17.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p><span>For those&nbsp;Punch&nbsp;first, ask question later. I would let the hero develop some bonding time with Tempest, let the Heros and tempest fight off a few dinos before letting Haka in the scene. I would let Haka be very Vocal and very emotional. To her Tempest is Dawn, let the Heroes know that and how horrible Dawn is. Your group may fail at this and it is ok. Failure is part of comics.</span></p>",
